{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28109","headline":"到蜀後记途中经历 · 雍陶","name":"到蜀後记途中经历","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劒峯重叠雪云漫，忆昨来时处处难。\n大散岭头春足雨，褒斜谷里夏犹寒。\n蜀门去国三千里，巴路登山八十盘。\n自到成都烧酒熟，不思身更入长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}